>> title: White Sauce
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: yogurt, mayonnaise, halal cart, sauce, no-cook
>> counters: Shawarma Counter, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: white sauce, halal cart white sauce, the white one, cart sauce, sauce blanche
>> pairs-with: pita-bread, toum, tahini-sauce
>> servings: 12
>> time: 1 hr 10 min
>> step.1: whisk the base smooth
>> step.2: loosen with vinegar and lemon
>> step.3: whisk in the garlic and herbs
>> step.4: chill 1 hr to marry

Whisk @mayonnaise{1%cup}(230 g) and @whole-milk yogurt{1/2%cup}(120 g) together until there is no streaking.

Loosen @&(~1)base{} with @distilled white vinegar{1%Tbs}(15 mL), @lemon juice{1%Tbs}(15 mL), @granulated sugar{1%tsp}(4 g) and @water{2%Tbs}(30 mL) until it pours in a ribbon rather than a blob.

Whisk @garlic{2%cloves}(grated on a rasp), @dried oregano{1%tsp}, @flat-leaf parsley{2%Tbs}(chopped fine), @kosher salt{1/2%tsp} and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}(coarse) into @&(~1)thinned base{}.

Chill @&(~1)white sauce{} ~chill{1%hr} before it goes anywhere near a plate.
